# 34. Important Set Methods

| Method                   | Purpose                                             |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `add()`                  | Adds one item                                       |
| `update()`               | Adds multiple items                                 |
| `remove()`               | Removes an item and raises an error if missing      |
| `discard()`              | Removes an item without raising an error if missing |
| `pop()`                  | Removes an arbitrary item                           |
| `clear()`                | Removes all items                                   |
| `copy()`                 | Creates a copy                                      |
| `union()`                | Combines sets                                       |
| `intersection()`         | Finds common elements                               |
| `difference()`           | Finds elements in one set but not another           |
| `symmetric_difference()` | Finds elements that are not common                  |
| `issubset()`             | Checks whether one set is a subset                  |
| `issuperset()`           | Checks whether one set is a superset                |
| `isdisjoint()`           | Checks whether two sets have no common elements     |

